/P 445 0 R
/E (In order to concurrently estimate damage, flood extent, and footprints, the authors offer Flood-DamageSense, which combines SAR, VHR optical basemaps, and flood-risk layers via a Mamba-based semi-Siamese encoder with multi-task decoders. The results are aggregated to building-level maps via median pooling across polygons. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [8]
